## 1. HOW TO CREATE A ChatClientAgent

### Option 1: Using Constructor with String Parameters
```csharp
var agent = new Microsoft.Agents.AI.ChatClientAgent(
    chatClient: IChatClient,          // Required: the LLM connection
    instructions: string,              // Optional: system instructions
    description: string = null,        // Optional: description 
    name: string = null,              // Optional: agent name
    tools: IList<Microsoft.Extensions.AI.AITool> = null,  // Optional: tools
    loggerFactory: ILoggerFactory = null,  // Optional: logging
    serviceProvider: IServiceProvider = null   // Optional: DI services
);
```

### Option 2: Using Constructor with ChatClientAgentOptions
```csharp
var options = new Microsoft.Agents.AI.ChatClientAgentOptions
{
    Id = "unique-id",
